.config/

# Local environment. `.env` used to be force-tracked here with `!.env`, on the
# reasoning that it held nothing secret. That is true today (one ping message),
# but it makes the safe-looking act of adding a key to .env silently commit it.
# Tracked template lives in .env.example instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

